    <item>
      <title>MEDIA RELEASE: Record number of schools set to compete at 2026 National Secondary School Waka Ama</title>
      <link>https://wakaama.co.nz/stories/read/1006765</link>
      <description>A record 142 secondary schools and 2,300 participants from across Aotearoa will gather at Lake Tikitapu next week for the 2026 Secondary School Waka Ama Championships, highlighting the continued growth of waka ama among rangatahi nationwide.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://wakaama.co.nz/stories/read/1006765</guid>
